FEM Trophy Truck
;generated by tools/make_skin_car.py from trophy_truck_v2/UnlimitedTrophyTruck: a shell of FEM triangles wrapped round the mod's meshes on ring frames and
;longitudinals of FEM members, the Shell Car's suspension scaled to its wheels, ring tyres; its look the mod's meshes as
;flexbodies skinned to the shell's nodes (the sheet body and the plates are there and not drawn)
;resources: ../trophy_truck_v2
